# Beastie Beatdown without delirium (CR 207.2c): Bot1's graveyard holds a Culling the Weak (instant) and the Ornithopter it
# sacrificed (artifact, creature): three types, one short of four, so no counters; the Grizzly Bears deal their own 2 to
# Bot2's Cogwork Librarian (3/3), which survives. Bot2's graveyard holds a Forest (a fourth type, land) discarded to Mox Diamond:
# it is not Bot1's graveyard and does not count - had it counted, the Bears would have gotten counters and killed the Librarian.
# Both targets are required: two of Bot1's own creatures, or the opponent's creature first and Bot1's second, are refused.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Grizzly Bears
Culling the Weak
Beastie Beatdown
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Cogwork Librarian
Mox Diamond
Forest
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Cogwork Librarian.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Diamond.Cast
Bot2.Accept
Bot2.Choose(Forest)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Beastie Beatdown.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears; Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
! Bot1.Hand.Beastie Beatdown.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Cogwork Librarian; Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Culling the Weak.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Beastie Beatdown.Cast
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Cogwork Librarian)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Cogwork Librarian.Damage = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Power = 2
Bot1.Graveyard = Beastie Beatdown; Culling the Weak; Ornithopter
Bot2.Graveyard = Forest
